VERSION 2
RULE transport.tls-environment-bypass VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "(?i)\\b(?:NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED|PYTHONHTTPSVERIFY)[\"']?\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"']?0\\b|\\bGIT_SSL_NO_VERIFY[\"']?\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"']?(?:true|1)\\b" ""
REPORT "TLS Verification Disabled By Environment"
SEVERITY MEDIUM
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
